NexaVideo - Original Short-Video Social Platform

NexaVideo is an Android-first short video platform where users watch, upload, and share short videos.

Features:
• Home Feed - Trending videos with backend API
• Shorts - Vertical swipe with AI captions
• Create & Upload - Pick video, add caption, upload
• Likes, Comments, Follow, Save
• Inbox / Messaging - Chat with creators
• Notifications - FCM powered
• Profile - Creator data model
• Creator Earnings - Ledger & Payout system
• Search - Find videos & users
• Admin Reports & Moderation

Built with:
Android Jetpack Compose, ExoPlayer, Retrofit, DataStore, Docker + PostgreSQL, GitHub Actions CI

This is the official PRO FINAL build for production.

